This repository uses GeoNames cities500 data under CC BY 4.0 to derive station
location fields. This product includes data created by GeoNames
(www.geonames.org), licensed under CC BY 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

metadata/coastline.geojson is a clipped extract of OpenStreetMap land polygons,
licensed under ODbL 1.0. Credit: OpenStreetMap contributors.
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Station context names the OpenStreetMap bay or strait a station sits in,
derived from metadata/water-bodies.geojson, an extract of OpenStreetMap
licensed under ODbL 1.0. Credit: OpenStreetMap contributors.
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Station countries for registry records are derived from
metadata/maritime-zones.geojson, an extract of the Marine Regions Maritime
Boundaries Geodatabase (Exclusive Economic Zones) by the Flanders Marine
Institute (marineregions.org), licensed under CC BY 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
